  "body": "Corresponds to issue #5269.\n\nThis pull request removes `concept-SharedWorkerGlobalScope-type`.\n`SharedWorkerGlobalScope` inherits `WorkerGlobalScope` which already has [`type`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#concept-workerglobalscope-type) member, so we don't need to recreate `type` member for `SharedWorkerGlobalScope`.\n\nAlso `options`' `type` member was initialized twice, so this step is removed as well.\n\nThis bug occurred in pull request #5258.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5276/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 12, 2020, 10:01 AM UTC (b35a608)\">/workers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5276/f50ef72...b35a608/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 12, 2020, 10:01 AM UTC (b35a608)\">diff</a> )",
